cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "SAFE-SILENCE: Receiver-Verifiable Semantic Telemetry for Underwater Digital Twins"
message: >-
  If you use SAFE-SILENCE in your research, please cite this software
  and the associated research paper. Use the version-specific Zenodo
  citation for the software release you used when available.
authors:
  - given-names: "Abdul"
    family-names: "Rehman"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbdulRehman88/SAFE-SILENCE"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A configurable research pipeline for ocean-data preparation,
  predictive semantic evidence, simulated acoustic communication,
  receiver trust, relay fusion, scheduling, bounded recovery,
  paired statistical evaluation, and manuscript figure generation.
keywords:
  - underwater communication
  - semantic telemetry
  - receiver-verifiable silence
  - digital twins
  - bounded recovery
  - reproducible research
version: "0.20.1"
date-released: "2026-10-15"
